From e2d542cfe8ab1801772ecb8ef7f2eaebb163a16f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ravindra Lakkireddy <85186928+rlakki08@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 22:10:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(assets): Hunyuan results were never read --
 gradio_client 2.x already downloaded them (the /file= fetch was a 403); hf
 mode keeps a squashed depth guess

Live on :8009 (2026-09-26): both Hunyuan Spaces generated (2.1: 13 s shape, 2: 4 s), then every call
"failed" on 403 Forbidden fetching {src}/file=<path>: that path is the local copy gradio_client 2.7
already downloaded. _resolve_remote_file reads a local path first, then the Space's prefixed route with
the client's headers/cookies, then the old URL.
- a photo the Space just failed on isn't sent again for 10 min (on-demand + the warm queue retried the
  same photo back to back: 4 wasted generations)
- hf mode keeps Hunyuan's mesh up to 200% residual (a thin window frame came back 74% off on depth, a
  guess squashed to size; auto still drops > 60%, the 10-pack case was 9000%)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 server/assets.py         | 77 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 tests/test_asset_mode.py | 40 +++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/server/assets.py b/server/assets.py
